This repository contains no model weights. It works with, and ships one small numerical table
(ph3_control/data/ph3_adaln_map.safetensors, 16x8 matrix + 8 bias values fitted from the adaLN time tables of
P-H3-Image and of the MiniMax H3 model) computed only from the time-embedding tables (adaln_t_table) of those models, with no layer weights. That table is
